					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13941886#post-4846202</guid>
				<title>Re: Formatting help</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13941886/formatting-help#post-4846202</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 16 Dec 2020 14:05:38 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Hexick</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5065702</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'd also like to point out that you have one too many open brackets at the beginning of the component code. The whole tool won't work unless the excess bracket is excised. Example:</p> <p>Original:</p> <div class="code"> <div class="hl-main"> <pre> <span class="hl-brackets">[</span><span class="hl-code">[[</span><span class="hl-var">include</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-var">:smlt:component:aers:classification-stuff</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">item</span><span class="hl-code">=</span><span class="hl-var">6000</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">lvl</span><span class="hl-code">=</span><span class="hl-var">4</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">class</span><span class="hl-code">=</span><span class="hl-var">Safe</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">threat</span><span class="hl-code">=</span><span class="hl-var">Yellow</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">threat-colour</span><span class="hl-code">=#</span><span class="hl-var">j01</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-brackets">]</span><span class="hl-code">]</span> </pre></div> </div> <p>Updated:</p> <div class="code"> <div class="hl-main"> <pre> <span class="hl-brackets">[</span><span class="hl-code">[</span><span class="hl-var">include</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-var">:smlt:component:aers:classification-stuff</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">item</span><span class="hl-code">= $</span><span class="hl-var">item</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">lvl</span><span class="hl-code">= $</span><span class="hl-var">lvl</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">class</span><span class="hl-code">= $</span><span class="hl-var">class</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">threat</span><span class="hl-code">= $</span><span class="hl-var">threat</span><span class="hl-code"> |</span><span class="hl-var">threat-colour</span><span class="hl-code">= $</span><span class="hl-var">colour</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-brackets">]</span><span class="hl-code">]</span> </pre></div> </div> <p>And, yeah, going off of what Croq said, the color hex to turn the dot yellow would be <tt>#ffff00</tt>.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13941886#post-4846024</guid>
				<title>Re: Formatting help</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13941886/formatting-help#post-4846024</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 16 Dec 2020 09:03:35 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Croquembouche</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2893766</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The threat colour, #j01 (aka #J01, aka #JJ0011), is a HTML colour hex code. You can change the colour by looking up the hex code of the colour you want. There are also several (140) named HTML colours like &quot;red&quot;, &quot;yellow&quot;, &quot;gold&quot; that you can look up that will probably also work in this component.</p> <p>Noting that #JJ0011 isn't a valid HTML colour, so I'd imagine the colour you have there doesn't work currently.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13941886#post-4845814</guid>
				<title>Formatting help</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13941886/formatting-help#post-4845814</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 16 Dec 2020 01:48:37 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Timelord01</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2040976</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>How do I change the ball from red to yellow?<br /> [[[include :smlt:component:aers:classification-stuff<br /> |item=6000<br /> |lvl=4<br /> |class=Safe<br /> |threat=Yellow<br /> |threat-colour=#j01<br /> ]]</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
